{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國異端邪教「攝理教」教主鄭明析，因利用宗教洗腦性侵16名女信徒，周一（19日）被大田地方法院一審判處有期徒刑33年。</p><p>法院同時下令公開其個人資料、限制其在兒童及青少年相關機構就業10年，以及佩戴電子腳鐐15年。</p><p>同案被控加害的「二號人物」金智善被判監7年。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T04:39:24.612288+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:21:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T04:38:13.788068+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T04:38:13.788068+00:00","content_hash":"e6bc614bca7ef9e19ee0396ef0398e106e19768d92810dbe5e771580da2750d2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}